@baseUrl = http://localhost:5197

### Available prompt blocks and existing executable model profiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/config

### Read-only teaching inspector: all synthetic customers, never a chat authorization grant.
### Orders/Returns must be running; unavailable or malformed upstream => 502 shop_service_unavailable.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo-data

### Exact configured instructions, without inference or persisted state
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/prompts/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "live",
  "modelProfileId": "gpt5",
  "promptProfile": "good",
  "promptBlocks": {
    "checklist": true,
    "outputContract": true,
    "examples": true,
    "redundancy": false,
    "conflictingStyle": false
  }
}

### Rejected: null is not a valid block selection (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/prompts/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "promptBlocks": null
}
